      },
      {
        "heading": "What markets and products generate most obligations?",
        "body": "Engineering Services generated $140M in FY2026 to date. Guided Missile and Space Vehicle Manufacturing generated $66.1M, and Research and Development in the Physical, Engineering, and Life Sciences (except Nanotechnology and Biotechnology) generated $55.1M. Smaller markets include Search, Detection, Navigation, Guidance, Aeronautical, and Nautical System and Instrument Manufacturing at $11.6M and Radio and Television Broadcasting and Wireless Communications Equipment Manufacturing at $8.3M."
      }
    ]
